# Go build settings every relay build and test shares, read by the Makefile,
# the CI scripts and workflows, and the Dockerfile. KEY=value is valid
# Make-include and shell-source syntax.

# Empty builds encoding/json on Go's default v2 engine. nojsonv2 restores the
# classic engine; then regenerate the allocation baseline (make bench-baseline),
# which is measured on v2. Recheck on every Go upgrade.
GOEXPERIMENT=
